stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED
    QUEUED --> RESERVED : CallAllocator.allocate() — agent + borrower locked
    RESERVED --> INITIATED : EventWorker dispatches outbox to provider
    RESERVED --> CANCELLED : recovery (pre-initiation crash recovery)
    INITIATED --> RINGING : RINGING event from provider
    INITIATED --> FAILED : provider dispatch error / timeout
    RINGING --> ANSWERED : ANSWERED event
    RINGING --> FAILED : FAILED / BUSY / NO_ANSWER event
    ANSWERED --> CONNECTED : CONNECTED event
    CONNECTED --> COMPLETED : COMPLETED event
    CONNECTED --> FAILED : FAILED event
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of RESERVED
        idempotency_key ensures single write
        outbox record created atomically
        agent.status = RESERVED
        borrower.status = RESERVED
    end note

    note right of INITIATED
        provider_call_id stored
        agent.status = DIALING
    end note

    note right of COMPLETED
        TERMINAL STATE — no further transitions
        Late events marked is_out_of_order=true
        agent returned to AVAILABLE
        borrower moved to CALLED
    end note
